---
args: {"candidate": "PackageCandidate", "offers": "QuoteOption[]", "replies": "TermReply[]", "mandate": "MandateBoundary", "book": "NegotiationBook"}
returns: "PackageAcceptance"
---
Recheck offer validity against the current evidenced time immediately before presenting availability. Match each required term's acceptance and signature to this complete package and mandate edition. Do not use an expired quote, verbal-only reply requiring writing, or a price recomputed under a different FX basis. Keep remaining conditions explicit. A changed offer reopens all packages using it; preserve unaffected accepted terms. Return accepted only for complete, mutually consistent commitments with actual configured signature evidence.
